# Hando project

- Product display name is **Hando**. Change it only via `apps/web/lib/core/config/app_branding.dart` (`kAppDisplayName`). Do not hardcode "Asset OS" in UI.
- Keep package/repo ids (`asset_os`, `asset-os`) unless explicitly asked to rename them.
- Client is **Flutter web only** in `apps/web`. Do not create or commit `android/`, `ios/`, `linux/`, `macos/`, or `windows/` under the app.
- Product SoT: `docs/vision/complete-idea-summary.md`. Do not contradict local-first / offline-first / cloud-optional philosophy.
- Dev entrypoints: `.\scripts\wsl.ps1 …` (Windows) or `./scripts/dev.sh …` (WSL). Prefer these over ad-hoc Flutter commands.
- Prefer extending existing shell/flows over new frameworks or chart-heavy dashboards.
